marks</strong> (55% for <strong data-end=\"268\" data-start=\"248\">SC/ST candidates</strong>, where vacancies are reserved for them) or an <strong data-end=\"335\" data-start=\"315\">equivalent grade</strong> in the aggregate of all semesters/years. In addition, candidates must have <strong data-end=\"454\" data-start=\"411\">at least 3 years of relevant experience</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.7913%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Manager (Technical\u2013Electrical) in Grade-B</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.2087%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong data-end=\"223\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"134\">Bachelor\u2019s Degree in Electrical Engineering or Electrical and Electronics Engineering</strong> with a <strong data-end=\"255\" data-start=\"231\">minimum of 60% marks</strong> (55% for <strong data-end=\"285\" data-start=\"265\">SC/ST candidates</strong>, where vacancies are reserved for them) or an <strong data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"332\">equivalent grade</strong> in the aggregate of all semesters/years. In addition, candidates must have <strong data-end=\"471\" data-start=\"428\">at least 3 years of relevant experience</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.7913%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Assistant Manager-Rajbhasha in Grade-A</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.2087%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong data-end=\"58\" data-start=\"26\">Second Class Master\u2019s Degree</strong> in <strong data-end=\"132\" data-start=\"62\">Hindi/Hindi Translation, English, Sanskrit, Economics, or Commerce</strong>, as per prescribed combinations with <strong data-end=\"225\" data-start=\"170\">English and/or Hindi at the Bachelor\u2019s degree level</strong>, and in some cases a <strong data-end=\"286\" data-start=\"247\">Postgraduate Diploma in Translation</strong>. Alternatively, candidates holding <strong data-end=\"386\" data-start=\"322\">Master\u2019s Degrees in both English and Hindi/Hindi Translation</strong> (with at least one in Second Class) are also eligible. <strong data-end=\"484\" data-start=\"442\">Knowledge of bilingual word processing</strong> is desirable.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.7913%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Assistant Manager-Protocol &amp; Security in Grade-A</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.2087%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidate must be an <strong data-end=\"84\" data-start=\"25\">Officer with at least ten years of Commissioned Service</strong> (<strong data-end=\"120\" data-start=\"86\">five years for PwBD candidates</strong>) in the <strong data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"129\">regular Army, Navy, or Air Force</strong>, and must possess a <strong data-end=\"223\" data-start=\"186\">valid Ex-Serviceman Identity Card</strong>. For further details, refer to the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/railway-rrb-group-d-level-1-recruitment-2026-chk/\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #000000;\" target=\"_blank\">Railway RRB Group-D (Level-1) Recruitment 2026</a></span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0How To Check &amp; Download RBI Non CSG Various Post Final Result / Score Card 2026\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">\u00a0Visit the official <strong>Reserve Bank of India (RBI) website.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">\u00a0On the homepage, click on the <strong>\u201cRBI Non CSG Various Post Result / Score Card 2026\u201d</strong> link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">\u00a0Enter your <strong>Registration Number/Roll Number and Date of Birth/Password.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">\u00a0Fill in the <strong>Captcha Code and click on the Login/Submit button.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">\u00a0Your result <strong>will appear on the screen.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">\u00a0Check your qualifying <strong>status, marks, and other details carefully.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">\u00a0Download the <strong>Result/Score Card PDF</strong> for future reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">\u00a0Take a printout of the <strong>result for future use.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0RBI Non CSG Various Post Recruitment 2026 : </span>Mode Of Selection\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Prelims Written Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Mains Written Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Language Proficiency Test</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\n<li><s